From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 04:14:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: media: apple,t8140-ave: name the T8132 encoder
 resources

The T8132 branch of the binding lists five reg ranges and up to six
power domains but neither their names nor the preloaded firmware
regions, while the driver maps codec, mailbox and coproc by name,
attaches the dma, pipe4, pipe5, me0, me1 (and optional perf) power
domains by name, and takes the firmware from memory-region. With
unevaluatedProperties: false a T8132 node that the driver can use fails
dtbs_check ("power-domain-names", "reg-names" unexpected).

Describe reg-names, power-domain-names and memory-region for the T8132
as the binding already does for the other generations (codec, mailbox,
coproc, then pmgr or power-control, then fabric or pio; the five pipe
domains and an optional perf floor), and require both name lists.

Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 .../bindings/media/apple,t8140-ave.yaml       | 25 +++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,t8140-ave.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,t8140-ave.yaml
index f02744fd0c..7718b50cc7 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,t8140-ave.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/media/apple,t8140-ave.yaml
@@ -67,6 +67,24 @@ allOf:
           minItems: 1
           maxItems: 6
 
+        reg-names:
+          items:
+            - const: codec
+            - const: mailbox
+            - const: coproc
+            - enum: [pmgr, power-control]
+            - enum: [fabric, pio]
+
+        power-domain-names:
+          minItems: 5
+          items:
+            - const: dma
+            - const: pipe4
+            - const: pipe5
+            - const: me0
+            - const: me1
+            - const: perf
+
         iommus:
           minItems: 1
           maxItems: 2
@@ -74,11 +92,18 @@ allOf:
         clocks:
           maxItems: 1
 
+        memory-region:
+          items:
+            - description: Preloaded firmware text
+            - description: Preloaded firmware data
+
       required:
         - compatible
         - reg
+        - reg-names
         - interrupts
         - power-domains
+        - power-domain-names
         - iommus
     else:
       allOf:
